WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.020
<i>Previously on Phantom in the Twilight.</i>

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.800
The Tower of London.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.730
Is Shinyao there?

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.730
Wayne, I have a request.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:13.870
If we're defeated and it looks like Ton 
and Shinyao will fall into enemy hands...

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.590
<i>Don't say such ominous things.</i>

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.320
If that happens, you do something.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.870
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.980
They just need to survive.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.800
I don't care if we get 
caught in the crossfire.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.380
Destroy it all.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.090
I'm counting on you, Lord of Gluttony.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:34.260
Jeez.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:38.480
You're a coward, vampire.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:16.990
<b>Episode 11
 Final Battle in the Dark</b>

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:34.710
Ah, the Tower of London.

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:37.010
It's truly a treasury of Umbra.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:42.280
Throughout its long history, wars and 
executions have been conducted here.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:45.150
It must be the most cursed place in London.

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:49.080
Add your spells to the mix, and...

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:53.770
I'll prepare to greet our guests.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.840
While you're doing that, 
we'll have to get even stronger.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:01.300
It's time to save them,

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.200
my little Shinyao.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:18.050
You're the best, Shinyao.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:21.260
Not even a demon could beat you.

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:25.770
We're almost at the Tower of London.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.600
Is everyone ready?

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.810
By the way, why are we 
attacking from the river?

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:36.070
They'll roll out the red carpet 
for us wherever we come from.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:39.550
In other words, it'll be a 
tough battle no matter what.

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:44.030
So doesn't it make sense to pick 
the most picturesque location?

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.240
I've never heard that logic before.

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:56.280
It's time for our final battle.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:59.990
Fight beautifully and die beautifully, boys.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.140
You're starting to sound like Van Helsing.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:09.890
I'm nothing like that immortal meathead.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.530
Thanks, guys.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:18.400
You're trying to make me laugh 
so I don't worry too much, right?

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:19.890
Are we?

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.320
I'm being serious.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:24.150
Everything seems perfectly normal to me.

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.080
Let's go, then.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:31.580
Let's fight so we can all go home together.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.250
Well, well.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.090
We're here, Midnight Sun.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.130
Open the gate.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.760
I wish I could, but unfortunately

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.140
I only sent one invitation.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:53.200
Now, then.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.550
He's not opening the gate.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:08.720
I see. In that case, it's up to you.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.800
Clear a path for us.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:13.780
Are you sure this wasn't a mistake?

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:14.290
They're attacking.

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:29.470
I guess I should get going.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:38.890
It's no wonder they've been 
tasked with managing London,

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:40.880
the heart of the Twilights.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.690
They're truly powerful.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:48.300
But an unimaginable number 
of souls wander here.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:53.200
They can't erase them all in one night.

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.090
All right!

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:12.850
Come on.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.390
There's no end to them.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.270
This might give us some trouble.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:20.440
Don't.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:21.750
Vlad.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:23.110
We're not changing the plan.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.840
You're not fighting until we find Shinyao.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:26.340
But—

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.800
You promised.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:31.490
You're going to meet your friend 
as the human Baileu Ton.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.240
But at this rate, we'll never get through.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.370
We'll never find Shinyao.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:40.600
Don't underestimate us.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.460
Toryu?

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:44.280
I'll open the gate.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:47.250
The rest of you sneak in after me.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:49.090
You can't go in there alone.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:53.350
I don't want you to 
sacrifice yourself for me.

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:57.060
Yes. That would be a simple 
equivalent exchange.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.260
It's hardly acceptable.

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:00.160
What?

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:05.150
But I have a talented mage 
who will fix me if I break.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:07.440
You mean...

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:11.030
Vlad, I'm leaving the rest to you.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.700
Just so you know, I'm not worried at all.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.150
Of course not.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:18.650
I'm tougher than you are.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:20.960
Toryu!

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:23.830
Let's follow him, Ton.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.860
What are they doing?

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.970
I won't let you get in our way.

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:53.330
They're through the first gate.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:58.940
Their moment of destiny is approaching.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:06.420
That's an ugly way to fight, my doll.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:09.910
No, I suppose that's in the past now.

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.980
Toryu. Toryu!

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:25.430
It seems they made it through.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:30.850
It's time for me to apply 
the finishing touches.

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:45.880
Toryu.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.460
Don't look back, Ton.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.840
We have to keep moving forward.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:01.910
Luke, you can move now.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:04.570
Toryu.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:08.900
I promise we'll save him and Shinyao.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:20.520
They've been successfully lured inside.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:24.250
How are things going over there?

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.000
<i>According to plan.</i>

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.880
<i>Activate the system.</i>

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.830
You're really going to do this?

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.640
Unlike with Shinyao, 
 we can't use any sensors.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:35.220
<i>Its effectiveness is rather limited.</i>

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.300
Let's take it for a test drive.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:45.230
We'll see if your new Magic 
Mirror works on Umbra.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.850
Don't blame me if it doesn't work.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.120
Brother.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:08.530
Huh?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:09.880
What is it?

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.950
Luke's gone.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.770
Chris.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:20.950
Chris.

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.000
Hey, Chris.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.280
Brother.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:27.640
Chris, hang in there.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.060
What are you—

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.620
Thanks, Brother.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:33.820
You chose me over Ton.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.500
You...

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.950
It's too obvious at close range.

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:48.000
You bastard.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:52.500
But you couldn't help but wonder for a moment

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.250
if it was the real Chris.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:02.390
There's still plenty of room for improvement.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:06.650
But for now, it's useful 
enough for buying time.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.630
Are you sure we don't have to go back?

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.040
I told you.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.840
Turning back isn't an option for us.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.780
What's that?

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:27.430
So this is their play.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:32.500
No... no...

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.360
It's good to see you again, Vlad.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:38.300
Rijan.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.260
Great-grandmother?

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.010
What are you—

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.140
Stay back.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:48.220
Only my descendants can pass through here.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.270
Baileu Ton, only you.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:53.930
What?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:58.510
Besides, I don't want to fight you, Vlad.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.200
Try to understand.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:04.210
B-But a hundred years ago, 
my great-grandmother...

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:07.740
Yeah, she disappeared

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:11.810
so no one would see that 
she'd become an Umbra.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:14.490
That's an Umbra, then?

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:15.280
Yes.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:18.750
If you continue using your power...

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:22.300
Give her to me, Vlad.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.130
Rijan, why are you doing this?

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:27.300
Then I'll return to you.

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:31.190
Vlad, you're not actually interested

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:34.270
in the coexistence of humans
 and Umbra, are you?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.230
What?

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:40.530
Time has stopped for you since you lost me.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:45.110
You chose to stop seeking 
blood and slowly rot away,

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:49.280
killing time by watching over 
the Twilights I left you.

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.060
What are you talking about?

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.080
Vlad is—

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.840
Thank you, Vlad.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.410
But you don't need to do that anymore.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.970
From now on, I'll stand by your side.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:05.300
For a hundred years, I waited for you.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.760
Wishing only to be reunited with you,

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:12.220
I didn't know what to do 
with this immortal body.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:16.770
Until a few days ago.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:17.940
What?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.860
But now at my side

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.900
I have an inexperienced human 
who inherited your soul.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:27.690
She's immature, noisy, and rash,

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:30.620
but her soul is also overflowing with hope.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:33.580
So I can't go with you.

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.000
Ton, listen closely.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:49.460
I see. So that's how it is.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.780
Then I'll take her by force.

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.350
Too bad, impostor.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:03.940
Your appearance is perfect,
 but you don't understand Rijan at all.

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:05.280
What?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:09.630
The self-sacrificing Rijan 
would never show such contempt

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:12.450
for her beloved great-granddaughter.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:15.440
People change after a hundred years.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.830
Don't you think so?

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.760
Absolutely not.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:22.840
After all, I believe in her noble purpose.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:24.750
You what?

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:27.790
Are you sure you don't love 
my great-grandmother too much?

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:28.800
It's infuriating.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.130
Of course I do.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:35.610
After all, the real Rijan is beautiful,
 noble, and mature.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.910
I know I'm just a child.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.160
I don't need you anymore.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.640
I'm going to save Shinyao myself.

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.300
Do what you want.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:48.360
I'll be here playing with this impostor.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:48.920
What?

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:52.810
I'm counting on you to handle this, Vlad.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:54.410
You bastard!

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:06.710
Wayne, protect Ton.

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:09.300
<i>Ow!</i>

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:11.640
Wayne?

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.970
That hurt, Vlad.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.760
Let's go, Wayne.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:20.120
Wait. Don't leave me.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:26.130
You're here, aren't you, Haysin?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.110
I thought you'd hesitate.

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:33.620
How did you know it was an impostor?

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.870
I smelled your blood on the wind.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:42.580
So it really isn't effective unless 
you've been brainwashed like Shinyao.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.500
What did you do with Luke?

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:48.590
You should probably go save him right now.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:50.610
You lowlife.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:55.330
Don't you think it's a waste 
for us to fight alone here?

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:59.520
Aren't you curious to see their final battle?

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:03.460
Unfortunately, I believe in her.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:08.850
No, I was made to believe

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:11.150
by those hopeful and honest eyes!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.730
Wh-What is that?

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:32.680
Is that...

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.600
Shinyao?

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.850
How awful.

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:40.040
This is too awful.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.060
Miss, stay away from her.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.020
Let's go, Shinyao.

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:50.140
Let's go back to our everyday lives.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.450
Unfortunately, you can't do that.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.420
Salvation, my little Shinyao.

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:58.660
Let's save Ton.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.120
Yes, let's go.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.580
Shinyao.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:07.190
Child of darkness 
who was never meant to live.

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:09.480
Return to me.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:10.930
What?

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.360
Watch out!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:16.390
Wayne!

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.850
I'm okay.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:37.780
What?

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:42.240
Come to your senses, human girl.

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:44.910
She's your friend.

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:47.750
You mustn't kill her.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:50.460
Mr. Helsing?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.710
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.200
Backup, where are you?

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.750
Release the girl!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:03.470
Saving all humans is Midnight Sun's duty!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.230
No, no, no!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.980
Shinyao, new plan!

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:09.230
Kill that monster first!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.530
No, wait! I mean save him!

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:16.140
It's good to see you again, miss.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.030
How has the count been?

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.580
U-Uh, this is no time for that conversation.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.300
Tell him

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:29.560
that the word "defeat" cannot be 
found in my dictionary.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.040
The next time we meet

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:35.630
is the day he'll die.

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:36.380
Watch out!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:41.510
Mr. Helsing, Shinyao is...

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:43.100
I know.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.550
I shall only fight Umbra.

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.770
I shall never harm a human!

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:53.520
Is he really human?

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.780
Damn it. Shinyao, after him!

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.620
Kill him before he gets here!

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:59.240
There you are!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.370
Backup!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:11.710
How dare you control people. 
Do you fancy yourself a god?

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:15.000
End this ridiculous ritual immediately!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:18.260
W-W-Wait! Hold on, Mr. Helsing!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.220
No, I shall not wait!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:24.680
I must do something before 
they become inhuman!

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:25.630
Huh?

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.280
Backup, are you all right?

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.200
Why?

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.650
Don't worry about it.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:48.680
No matter how rotten you are, 
you're still human.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:52.370
How could I not save you?

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.280
No!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:57.720
I got caught in her attack because of you!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.580
Ow!

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:03.390
I don't want to die, I don't want to die!

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:10.450
Backup, make the right choice 
as a human facing death.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:13.480
Release the girl.

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:15.210
Mr. Helsing.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:20.690
No way.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.820
I'm not listening to you.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.780
You bastard.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:31.360
Shinyao, now is the time.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:35.100
Save the entire world.

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:56.400
Hear me, ring.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.110
The real Sha Rijan.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:02.450
Grant me strength one last time.

00:22:35.040 --> 00:23:31.890
<b>Phantom 
Twilight Plus</b>

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:37.260
Phantom in the Twilight Plus!

00:22:38.780 --> 00:22:42.490
The final episode is brought 
to you by all the Twilights.

00:22:42.490 --> 00:22:45.760
We'll be discussing the location of 
the final battle, the Tower of London.

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:49.800
Study hard so it'll be useful 
whenever you come to visit.

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:53.050
London may be a bit far for our viewers.

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:55.770
Well, just in case they're interested.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.770
The Tower of London is the most important 
stronghold in English Umbra society.

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:05.570
A major Umbra living in the tower 
once ruled all the Umbra in England.

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:09.100
The friend Lydia mentioned in episode five,
 who lives in the Tower of London.

00:23:09.100 --> 00:23:14.410
Supposedly they're a noble who met 
an untimely death in the tower.

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:15.050
Huh?

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:16.540
Come to think of it,

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:18.330
even though we're fighting in 
the Tower of London right now,

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:20.250
we haven't seen them yet.

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:21.720
Oh...

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:23.210
Huh? What?

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:23.920
What does that mean?

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.310
What happened to them?

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:26.960
Ton, that's enough.

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.830
There are some things you're 
better off not knowing.

00:23:29.830 --> 00:23:30.830
Hey, wait.

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:31.970
Now I'm even more curious.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.280
This isn't better at all.

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:50.200
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:40.310
Thanks to all of us working together, 
I'm finally reunited with Shinyao.

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:42.690
Thank you. I'll never forget 
what you've done for me.

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:46.780
Wait, I'll save that for when 
we're all back at the café.

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:49.550
Final episode: Shadows That Remain at Dawn.

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:50.200
<b>Episode 12 Shadows That Remain at Dawn</b>
